{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49656","headline":"木兰花 一 · 欧阳炯","name":"木兰花 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"儿家夫婿心容易，身又不来书不寄。\n闲庭独立鸟关关，争忍抛奴深院里。\n闷向绿纱窗下睡，睡又不成愁已至。\n今年却忆去年春，同在木兰花下醉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"欧阳炯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49656.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49656","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}